installer-multisig-description-2
=> "The Primary Keys will compose a 2-of-2 multisig which will always be able to spend. In case one of your keys becomes unavailable, after a period of inactivity you will be able to recover your funds using the Recovery Key together with one of your Primary Keys (2-of-3 multisig):"
